[TITLE]
API-26: pump PU1 (speed 0.9) and PRV V1 (40 psi) supply J2 and J3; pipe P2 is closed
J2's demand is given in [JUNCTIONS], J3's in [DEMANDS]. J3 also has an emitter.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID  Elev  Demand
 J1  0     0
 J2  0     100
 J3  0     0

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID  Head
 R1  50

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  J2  J3  1000    8     100    0      Open
 P2  J1  J3  1000    8     100    0      Closed

[PUMPS]
;ID  N1  N2  Parameters
 PU1 R1  J1  HEAD C1  SPEED 0.9

[VALVES]
;ID  N1  N2  Diam  Type  Setting  Mloss
 V1  J1  J2  8     PRV   40       0

[DEMANDS]
;Junction  Demand
 J3        50

[EMITTERS]
;Junction  Coefficient
 J3        5

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow  Head
 C1  500   150

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[REPORT]
 Summary  No

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
